## Key Design Decisions

- **No Redux/Zustand** — dcc.Store + URL params sufficient for v1
- **Tailwind + Dash Bootstrap** — Utility-first CSS + component library pairing
- **Centralized API Client** — Single source of truth for all backend calls
- **10s Polling** — Acceptable for household use; WebSocket upgrade in v2
- **URL Params for Family Context** — SEO-friendly, shareable, stateless

